  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Crumbling Castle** (1 other source): The song included a brief tease of the track Witchcraft [2]\n- **Rattlesnake** (1 other source): Ambrose left the stage during the intro, with teases for Sleep Drifter and Honey [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Fucked Up Daily Jam**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Digital Black**: back after 42 archived shows (568 days) [4]\n- **Soy-Protein Munt Machine**: back after 42 archived shows (568 days) [4]\n- **Vomit Coffin**: back after 42 archived shows (568 days) [4]\n- **Murder Of The Universe**: back after 42 archived shows (568 days) [4]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Daily Blues [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2024-05-23** (recommended): source not stated; 20 songs; 117 min [1]\n- **kglw2024-05-23.Amsterdam24**: source not stated; 18 songs; 117 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Grace Cummings missed the show due to illness; Naarm band Dr Sure filled in [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2024-05-23**: taped by puffanug; transferred by puffanug; source: AT4041 > PMD661 [1]. Also: Recorded with AT4041 mics into PMD611 recorder at 24/96 wav format; Positioned front of barrier at left corner, eight and a half feet away [1]\n- **kglw2024-05-23.Amsterdam24**: taped by Tora Tapes; transferred by Tora Tapes; source: Lineage FOB > Zoom F3 + CA-14 > WAV > Audacity > WAV [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Reverholic: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Limited Edition Poster In Amsterdam NL At Afas Live On 23 May 2024 Home Decor Poster ](https://reverholic.com/product/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-limited-edition-poster-in-amsterdam-nl-at-afas-live-on-23-may-2024-home-decor-poster-canvas/) [5]\n- Poster by Elegant Themes: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard/Dr. Sure's Unusual Practice - Amsterdam, AFAS Live - 23 May 2024 - Über Röck](https://uber-rock.co.uk/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-dr-sures-unusual-practice-amsterdam-afas-live-23-may-2024/) [6]\n- Poster by Reverholic: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Limited Edition Poster In Amsterdam NL At Afas Live On 23 May 2024 All Over Print Shi](https://reverholic.com/product/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-limited-edition-poster-in-amsterdam-nl-at-afas-live-on-23-may-2024-all-over-print-shirt/) [7]",
